---
description: Barnes Maze Analyzer scientific and product rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Domain logic lives in `src/domain/`. Do not put scientific formulas in React components.
- Never assume 30 fps. Prefer MP4 timebase and media timestamps. `test51` is not integer 15.
- Never silently interpolate long gaps or treat disappearance as escape.
- Do not commit sample MP4s.
- Do not hard-code filenames `test50` / `test51` / `test53` in the tracker.
- Corrections are append-only. Raw automatic samples stay intact.
- Uncertain measurements stay empty/NA, not zero.
